<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RUT_BeastBulge_DreadRegistration.xml   UtinniPatches — SUMP_MECHANICS_1 S4

  Registers RUT_BeastBulge (S3, already shipped, DEPLOY_HOLD'd — see
  src/DEPLOY_HOLD.txt) as a dread source for RM_MapComponent_DreadField
  (S4, RM_MapComponent_DreadField.cs). A PATCH, not an edit to
  RUT_BeastBulge.xml itself — this pass's own scope says "do not touch
  S1/S2/S3/S5/S6," and the registration comp (RM_CompDreadSource) is
  designed exactly for this: any dread source attaches it without the
  MapComponent (or S3's own def) needing to know about the other.

  Gate: PatchOperationFindMod on the kit's display name. ⚠️ MayRequire on
  an <Operation> is INERT (MEASURED 2026-09-17 against 1.6 source —
  ModContentPack.LoadPatches never reads the attribute; PatchOperation has
  no such field). Un-gated, the <li Class="RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards.
  CompProperties_DreadSource"> below would try to resolve a type from an
  absent mod's assembly and discard this whole FILE, not just the parent
  def, the moment mandrake.rm.environmentalhazards is inactive — which per
  ENVHAZARDS_NEVER_ACTIVATED_1 is every load so far. FindMod is the only
  real per-operation gate; without the kit this operation is now a true
  no-op. (RUT_BeastBulge.xml's own ThingDef is itself MayRequire-gated at
  the top level, so this patch only ever matches when both are already
  present together.)

  Radius 8 is the spec's own S4 text verbatim: "radius INVENTED: 8 cells."

  DEPLOY_HOLD: grouped into RUT_BeastBulge's own existing hold entry in
  src/DEPLOY_HOLD.txt (this pass appends this filename to that same block)
  — this patch is meaningless without RUT_BeastBulge actually being live,
  same reasoning as every other file already held with it.
-->
<Patch>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>RimMandrake: Environmental Hazards Kit</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
      <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="RUT_BeastBulge"]/comps</xpath>
      <value>
        <li Class="RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards.CompProperties_DreadSource">
          <radius>8</radius>
        </li>
      </value>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
